# Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)

This is one of the primary focuses of this repository.

RAG is much more than embeddings and vector databases. It is the process of designing reliable retrieval systems that provide accurate context to language models.

## Topics

- Document Loading
- Chunking Strategies
- Embeddings
- Vector Databases
- Dense Retrieval
- Sparse Retrieval
- Hybrid Search
- Query Reformulation
- Query Expansion
- Metadata Filtering
- Cross-Encoder Reranking
- Multi-Hop Retrieval
- Context Compression
- Hallucination Reduction
- Evaluation
- Production RAG

Projects will gradually evolve from beginner implementations to production-ready retrieval systems.